<p>When an app asks to reset your encryption identity (your cross-signing keys), you approve or decline the request here. Approve only if you started that reset yourself, just now.</p>
<%= if @requests == [] do %>
<p>There is no pending request. Start "Reset identity" in your app first, then come back.</p>
<% else %>
<%= if !@fresh and !@no_auth_time do %>
<p>For your safety, confirm that it is you again with your company sign-in before you approve or decline a request.</p>
<p><a data-role="reauth" class="button" href="<%= @reauth_href %>">Confirm it's you</a></p>
<% end %>
<%= if @several do %>
<p class="notice problem" role="alert" data-role="reset-several"><strong>Problem:</strong> <%= length(@requests) %> reset requests are waiting. You started at most one of them. Decline every request you do not recognize; you can approve once only one is left.</p>
<% end %>
<%= for r <- @requests do %>
<section class="request" data-role="reset-request" aria-labelledby="request-<%= r.session_id %>">
<h2 id="request-<%= r.session_id %>">Request from <%= request_device(r) %></h2>
<dl>
<dt>App (name chosen by the app)</dt>
<dd><%= request_app(r) %></dd>
<dt>Device last active</dt>
<dd><%= time_tag(r.device_last_seen_ts, "Never") %></dd>
<dt>Requested</dt>
<dd><%= time_tag(r.requested_at * 1000, "just now") %> (<%= relative_time(r.requested_at) %>)</dd>
<dt>Expires</dt>
<dd><%= time_tag(r.expires_at * 1000, "soon") %> (<%= relative_time(r.expires_at) %>)</dd>
<%= if r.keys_fingerprint do %>
<dt>Request reference</dt>
<dd><%= r.keys_fingerprint %></dd>
<% end %>
</dl>
<p>Only approve if you started resetting your identity in that app just now. Your other devices and your contacts will have to verify you again.</p>
<p>If you decline, your current identity stays as it is and the app has to ask again.</p>
<%= if @fresh do %>
<div class="actions">
<form method="post" action="/account/cross_signing_reset/decline">
<input type="hidden" name="session_id" value="<%= r.session_id %>">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<%= @csrf_token %>">
<button type="submit" data-role="decline-reset" aria-label="Decline reset requested by <%= request_device(r) %>">Decline</button>
</form>
<%= if !@several do %>
<form method="post" action="/account/cross_signing_reset/approve">
<input type="hidden" name="session_id" value="<%= r.session_id %>">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<%= @csrf_token %>">
<input type="hidden" name="_click_proof" value="" data-click-proof>
<button type="submit" class="danger" data-role="approve-reset" aria-label="Approve reset requested by <%= request_device(r) %>">Approve reset</button>
</form>
<% end %>
</div>
<% end %>
</section>
<% end %>
<%= if @script? do %>
<script><%= @script %></script>
<% end %>
<% end %>
